6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,594
Purple is decent.

7
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,856
You can move small stuff...

8
00:00:15,876 --> 00:00:17,503
that's about it.

9
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,520
Yellow is pretty good.

10
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,352
Super speed.

11
00:00:23,372 --> 00:00:25,492
Nobody beats them in tag.

12
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,280
Gold is good.

13
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:33,164
Gold kids are the town heroes.

14
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,623
Black is rare.

15
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:39,787
Only a few people

16
00:00:39,807 --> 00:00:41,639
