17
00:00:42,371 --> 00:00:44,764
Everyone's a little scared of them.

18
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,233
Today was my Awakening Day.

19
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:52,100
I was so nervous.

20
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,960
I touched the crystal...

21
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,142
and nothing happened.

22
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,480
Everyone laughed at me.

23
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:03,850
I thought I had

24
00:01:03,870 --> 00:01:05,963
no power at all.

25
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:13,052
Then the ground started shaking...

26
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:16,191
Wait... what's happening?!

27
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:20,237
RAINBOW?!

28
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,343
The rarest power

29
00:01:21,363 --> 00:01:23,121
in the whole world!

30
00:01:26,090 --> 00:01:26,879
And this is just

31
00:01:26,899 --> 00:01:28,070
the beginning...

32
00:01:28,090 --> 00:01:29,980
Follow for part 2!

